{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>It is a pesach offering.</b> This offering is made on account of the passing over that was destined to occur at midnight of the following night. And since there is no offering at night, it was necessary to perform it during this period extending after the following night, in the manner of offerings. And it was necessary for each individual to offer it, for the miracle was performed for every individual in himself and not for the community as a collective."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:12.111280227Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}